    {
      "id": "memo-dfs-richer-ancestors",
      "title": "更富祖先记忆化 DFS",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "沿反向富有关系聚合最安静编号。",
      "steps": [
        "建立 richerThan[poor].add(rich)",
        "answer 初始化 -1",
        "dfs(person) 若已算返回；best=person，递归每个 rich，若 quiet[candidate]<quiet[best] 更新，缓存并返回"
      ],
